minimum value of the spectral gap and the parameter at which it occurs\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"1190ff72-a9fe-60f8-47af-f73fcf8b32c2"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
