     "47740231-7fc8-4299-6d0b-a47b7a7d10e3"], Cell[TextData[{
     "estimate of the total evolution time based on the adiabatic condition ",
     
     Cell[BoxData[
      RowBox[{"\|01d447", "\[NonBreakingSpace]", 
       RowBox[{
        StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], 
        FractionBox[
